<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id" />
  <para style="h">JO IBRU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga ma Kicoyo bot Jo Ibru</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jo Ibru</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ibru</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga ma Kicoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">JO IBRU</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk man pe ocake kit ma kicako kwede waraga mapol matye i Baibul, ento i agikine laco buk man ogiko calo giko waraga. En bene ocoyo buk man malube ki tekwaro pa Lujudaya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laco buk man ocoyo bot utmego ki nyimego ma oye Yecu Kricito ma onongo gin tye ki atematema mapol ma a ki bot jo ma dag lok pa Lubanga. Ma oweko niye pa jo mukene ocako doko goro.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laco buk man ocoyo ki diro kun cano kore ki kore lok ducu mapatpat.</para>
  <para style="ip">En ocuku cwiny utmego ki nyimego me cung matek i niyegi kun nyutu atir botgi ni Yecu Kricito lanyut me agiki ma oa ki bot Lubanga. Man en onyutu i yo adek mapatpat.</para>
  <para style="ip">Me acel Yecu Kricito obedo latin pa Lubanga ma lawiny, dok omwole wa i to. Macalo latin pa Lubanga Yecu Kricito dit kato lumalaika ducu dok bene loyo Moses ki lunebi mukene ducu. Me aryo Lubanga oyere me bedo ajwaka pa Lubanga maloyo ajwaki mukene ducu, dok en birii matwal. Me adek Yecu Kricito okoko dano ki i bal ki i lworo to.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laco buk man ocuku cwiny utmego ki nyimego me bedo ki niye matek macalo jo macon ma gin gubedo ki niye matek ci oweko Lubanga opwoyogi.</para>
  <para style="ip">En odolo te coce kun cuko cwiny utmego ki nyimego me bedo ki niye matek kadi bed atematema twero bino botgi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Yecu Kricito layab madit me agiki ma a ki bot Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yecu Kricito dit loyo lumalaika ducu <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:4-2:18">1:4—2:18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yecu Kricito dit loyo Moses ki Yocwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 3:1-4:13">3:1—4:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yecu Kricito loyo ajwaki pa Lubanga ducu <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14—7:28</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yecu Kricito dit loyo gicike ducu <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 8:1-9:22">8:1—9:22</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yecu Kricito gitum maloyo gitum mukene ducu <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 9:23-10:39">9:23—10:39</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Niye loyo jami ducu <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 11:1-12:29">11:1—12:29</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yomo cwiny Lubanga <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:1-19">13:1-19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lega me agiki <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:20-21">13:20-21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok me agiki <char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:22-25">13:22-25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga oloko kwedwa i Wode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Yam con Lubanga oloko ki kwariwa i dul lok mapol dok i yo mapatpat, kun loko wok ki i dog lunebi; <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />ento ikare man ma lacen ni en dong oloko kwedwa i Wode. Jami ducu matye, Lubanga ceng ocweyogi kun wok ki i wode, dok en oyubu ni myero en obed won jami ducu. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />En dero me deyo pa Lubanga, cal pa Lubanga kikome tye ikome, dok en bene ma tingo jami ducu matye ki teko me loke. Ma dong en otyeko tic me lwoko bal, en obedo piny i kabedo me deyo tung acuc inget Won Deyo Madwong matye malo i polo, <verse eid="HEB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />kun dong en odoko ladit mada makato lumalaika ducu, marom aroma ki kit ma nying ma kimiye ber matek makato meggi woko.<verse eid="HEB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wod pa Lubanga dit kato lumalaika ducu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Jab 2:7</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Cam 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Tek 17:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Lubanga yam kong owaco ki lamalaika mo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“In i Woda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">tin dong anywali”?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">Nyo dok ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“An abibedo Wone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">ki en bibedo Woda”?<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Nwo 32:43</ref> </char>
    </note> Dok bene ikare ma okelo latin kayo i lobo en owaco ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Lumalaika pa Lubanga ducu omyero guwore.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:4">Jab 104:4</ref> </char>
    </note> Ikom lumalaika, Lubanga oloko ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“En loko lumalaikane doko yamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">lutice en loko doko leb mac.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 45:6">Jab 45:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 45:7">7</ref> </char>
    </note> Ento ikom Wode en oloko ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Komkeri, in Lubanga, birii nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">odo keri en odo me ngolo kop atir.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />In imaro kit ma atir, cwinyi dag tim marac;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">pimeno Lubanga, ma en Lubangani, owiri ki moo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">moo me yomcwiny madwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">makato luwoti ducu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Jab 102:25-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note> En dok oloko ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“In Rwot i wiati iketo guti me lobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">polo bene en tic me cingi.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Gin birwenyo woko oyot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:11">ento in rii nakanaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:11">gin ducu gibitii macalo bongo,<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />ibidologi woko macalo ibano bongo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">kibilokogi macalo ginaruka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Ento in ibedo ma kiti tye acel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">mwakani pe bigik.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Jab 110:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Lubanga yam pe owaco ki lamalaika mo ni:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Bed ingeta tung acuc i kabedo me deyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">nio ka abimiyo lukwori</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">gidoko kom laten tyeni”<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Lumalaika kono dok gubedo angagi? Gin ducu gubedo cwiny mogo ma tiyo tic pa Lubanga; en orogi ka konyo jo ma binongo lare.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lare ma pire dit tutwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Pimeno wan myero waketu cwinywa tutwal i gin mayam wawinyo, wek pe wangak woko ki iye. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Lok me kwena mayam lumalaika gukelo onongo obedo lok ada. Ka ngat mo okalo wi cik mo, nyo okwero winyo, kimiye can iye ma oporo bal ma en obalo. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Wan kono dok wabibwot ningning ka pe waketo cwinywa i lare man ma pire dit tutwali? Lare man Rwot aye mukwongo tucu pire, ka dong jo mayam guwinyo ki bote, gumoko botwa loke. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Lubanga bene omedo cadene kun tiyo lanyut mogo ki tango ki tic madito mapatpat, dok kun bene poko mot mogo me Cwiny Maleng pi mitine kene.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Latel wiwa i yo me lare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Pien Lubanga pe oketo lobo ma mito bino ma wan waloko pire ni i teloc pa lumalaika. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Jab 8:4-6</ref> </char></note> Tye kamo ma kitucu kamaleng ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Dano gin ango, ma omiyo ipo pirgi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">Dano adana mamwa ma omiyo iparo pirgi?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Iketogi ki piny ite lumalaika pi kare manoknok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">imiyo ki gin woro madit dok iruku lalukana me deyo iwigi kit ma ki woro kwede rwodi;<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />iketogi me bedo lulo jami ducu.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Dong ka oketo jami ducu ite loc pa dano, pe oweko gin mo ma pe giloyo, kadi bed ikare man, pud peya waneno ka kiketo jami ducu ite twerogi. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Ento wan waneno Yecu mayam kikete piny ite lumalaika pi kare manoknok, ento kombedi dong kimiye deyo ki woro macalo rwot pi arem me to ma en ociro, wek pi kica pa Lubanga en obil to pi jo ducu.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Jami ducu tye pi Lubanga, dok en aye muketogi. Dong ka yam en omito kelo lutino mapol ideyone, gin ma en otimo obedo ma myero tutwal, en ma omiyo latel wigi i lare odoko dano muteggi pi ciro can. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Ngat ma olonyogi bedo maleng, ki jo ma kilonyogini, gin ducu gua ki ikom ngat acelu, ci en ki jo ma kilonyogi gitye ki won gi acel; man en aye gin ma omiyo lewic pe mako Yecu me lwongogi ni omegine, <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Jab 22:22</ref> </char></note> kun en waco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Abitito nyingi bot utmegina pi gin ma itiyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">abipaki ki wer i dye lwak mucoke.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:17">Ica 8:17</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:18">Ica 8:18</ref> </char>
    </note> Dok ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“Abiketo gena ikome.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Ki dok ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:13">“An a ene, ki lutino ma Lubanga dong omiya.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Kit macalo lutino ikare ducu giribe ikom ki remo, en bene kitmeno onywako kwedgi komgi ki remogi, wek pi tone enginy woko ngat matye ki twer ikom to, meno en aye Catan, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />ka dong wek egony jo mayam gubedo itwec me opii pi kare me kwogi ducu pi lworo to. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:8">Ica 41:8</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 41:9">9</ref> </char></note> Dong onen maber ni, gin ma en otimo pe okemo lumalaika, ento okemo likwayo pa Abraim. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Meno gin ma omiyo en myero odok marom aroma ki utmegine i yo ducu, wek omii ebed ajwaka madit pa Lubanga ma lakica dok lagen i tic pa Lubanga, wek omii ekwany woko bal pa jone wek ki tim botgi kica. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Pien en kikome yam bene oneno can dok Catan obite, en ma omiyo en twero konyo jo ma kibitogi.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yecu dit kato Moses</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Pimeno, wun utmegina maleng ma Lubanga olwongowu kacel kweda, kong wutam lok ikom Yecu ma en lakwena dok ajwaka madit me niye ma wan watucuni. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Wel 12:7</ref> </char></note> En obedo lagen bot Lubanga ma oyere dok okete i tic, marom aroma ki Moses mayam obedo lagen i ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Lager ot kimiye deyo madit makato ot; kitmeno Yecu bene nene kimiye deyo madit makato pa Moses woko. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Pien ot mo keken dano aye ma gero, ento ngat ma gero jami ducu en aye Lubanga. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Moses yam obedo lagen i ot pa Lubanga macalo latic, pi miyo caden ilok ma kibilokone ikare ma lacen. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Ento Kricito obedo lagen ikom ot pa Lubanga macalo Wode. Wan aye wa ode kace wamoko matek i tekcwinywa, ki i wakewa pi gen ma watye kwede.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yweyo pi jo pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Jab 95:7-11</ref> </char>
    </note> Dong macalo Cwiny Maleng oloko ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Ka wuwinyo dwon Lubanga tin,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />pe wumii cwinywu obed nwang calo jo mayam gujemo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:8">ikare ma guomo kwede cwinya i tim,<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />kama kwariwu guomo iye cwinya, gutema bene iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:9">kun gibedo kaneno tica pi mwaka pyere angwen kulu.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Pimeno cwinya owang ikom jo me kare meno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">omiyo awaco ni, ‘Gin kare ducu gungak woko itamgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:10">gin pe gingeyo yona wa ki acel.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Macalo yam akwongo ki kiniga ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Gin pe bidonyo i yweyo bota.’”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Wugwoke, utmegina, wek ngat mo ikinwu pe obed ki cwiny marac, cwiny ma pe ye Lubanga, matwero miyo en a woko ki bot Lubanga makwo. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Ento omyero wujing cwinywu kekenwu kare ducu ka pud wutwero lwongo ni, “Tin”, wek ngat mo ikinwu pe cwinye odok nwang pi bwola me bal. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Pien wan wabedo jo ma ribe ki Kricito, kace wamoko matek igenwa mukwongo nio wa i agiki, <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7">Jab 95:7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref> </char></note> macalo yam kiwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Ka wuwinyo dwone tin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">pe wumii cwinywu obed nwang calo jo mayam gujemo.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Wel 14:1-35</ref> </char>
    </note> Angagi mayam guwinyo dwon Lubanga ci gujemo wokoni? Pe gin lwak dano ducu mayam gua ki i lobo Ejipt ma kun Moses aye obedo ka telogi? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Dok angagi ce mayam cwinye owang ikomgi pi mwaka pyere angwen kuluni? Pe gin aye jo mayam gutimo bal, ma guto ci komgi odong i tim kunu? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Dok en yam pe okwongo kwong bot jo mene ce ni, gin pe gibidonyo i yweyo bote? Pe okwongo kwong meno bot jo mayam pe gubedo luwiny? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Pimeno wan waneno ni, jo meno yam pe gutwero donyo pien onongo gukwero ye Lubanga.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Pimeno cike me donyo i yweyo pa Lubanga pud tye, ento myero wabedu ma wagwoke, wek ngat mo ki ikinwu pe kinong ni opoto woko me oo iye. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Wan dong wawinyo lok me Kwena Maber bene calo gin, ento lok me kwena ma gin guwinyo pe okonyogi, pien pe gujolo ki niye. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Jab 95:11</ref> </char></note> Wan jo ma waye aye wabidonyo i yweyo meno mayam en oloko pire ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Macalo yam akwongo ki kiniga ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Gin pe bidonyo i yweyo bota.’”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">En owaco man kadi bed tice onongo dong yam otum woko cake i acaki piny. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Aca 2:2</ref> </char></note> Pien tye kamo kama yam en oloko ikom nino me abiro ni meno, “Lubanga oywe inino me abiro ki ikom tice ducu.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Jab 95:11</ref> </char></note> Ka dok kany en bene oloko ni: “Gin pe bidonyo kayweyo bota.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Kitmeno yo pud tye twolo wek jo mogo gudony iye. Jo mayam kikwongo tito botgi lok me Kwena Maber pe gudonyo, pien gin gukwero bedo ki winy. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7">Jab 95:7</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref> </char></note> En dok oketo nino mukene ma kilwongo ni, “Tin,” kun oloko lacen ki i dog Daudi madong onongo okato kare malac ata, ilok ma nene waloko pire ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Ka wuwinyo dwone tin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">pe wubed lujemo.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:7">Nwo 31:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:4">Nwo 22:4</ref> </char>
    </note> Pien ka kono yam Yocwa omiyogi yweyo, kono Lubanga pe dok oloko lacen pi nino mukene. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Pimeno, yweyo me ceng Cabit pud tye pi jo pa Lubanga; <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Aca 2:2</ref> </char></note> pien ngat madong odonyo i yweyo bot Lubanga nongo dong oywe woko ki i tice, calo Lubanga mayam oywe ki i ticeni.<verse eid="HEB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Dong piman, myero wayele me donyo i yweyo meno, wek omii ngat mo pe dok opot woko pi kwero bedo ki winy calo gin. <verse eid="HEB 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Pien lok pa Lubanga obedo gin makwo, dok tiyo matek, bit bene kato pala lucwan ma lebe bit ryoryo woko. Lok meno tucu iwa pil, tuc tungcel kama tipu ki cwiny gurwate iye, nyo kama wang mwot orwate iye ki moo ma i icogo, kun poko par ki tam mabecone ki maracune matye i idano. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Petye gin mo mukane ki bot Lubanga ma en pe neno, jami ducu ma en oketo odure woko kamaleng i wange, en aye ngat ma wabinyutu ticwa bote.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yecu en ajwaka pa Lubanga madit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Kit macalo dong watye ki ajwaka madit pa Lubanga tutwal madong otyeko donyo i polo, en Yecu, Wod pa Lubanga, pimeno omyero wamok matek i niye ma watucu. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Pien ajwaka madit ma watye kwede pe obedo ngat ma pe winyo arem kacel kwedwa pi gorowa, pien en bene Catan yam obite i yo ducu calo wan, ento en pe omedo ki timo bal mo. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Eyo, wan myero dong wanyiko cok inyim komker pa Lubanga ki tekcwiny, kama kica tye iye, wek otimwa kica, wanong bene kica ma konyowa ikare mamite.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Pien ajwaka madit pa Lubanga acel acel kiyero ki ikin lwak, ka kikete me tiyo tic inyim Lubanga ma ka kagi, kun tyero mot ki gitum pi bal. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />En twero tic ki dano ki mwolo, dok ki wa jo ma kwiya piny ki jo mungak, pien en kikome bene onongo goro oketo kome woko. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Lev 9:7</ref> </char></note> Piman, en myero otyer gitum pi bal ma mege, kacel ki pi bal pa lwak. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Nia 28:1</ref> </char></note> Dok bene pe tye ngat mo ma yere kene pi dit man, kono Lubanga aye ma lwonge iye, macalo olwongo Aron.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Jab 2:7</ref> </char>
    </note> Kitmeno bene, Kricito yam pe oketo deyo ikome kekene me bedo ajwaka madit pa Lubanga, ento Lubanga aye ma oyere, kun owace ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“In i Woda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">tin dong anywali.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Jab 110:4</ref> </char>
    </note> En bene owaco kamukene ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“In ibedo ajwaka madit pa Lubanga nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">ikit pa Melkijedek.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref> </char>
    </note> Yecu yam ocwalo legane bot Lubanga, ikare me kwone i lobo man, en aye obedo ngat mayam twero lare ki i to, kun bako doge ma pe twere ki koko ki pig wange, ci Lubanga bene owinye pi mwolone bote. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Kadi bed en obedo Wod pa Lubanga, yam en opwonye me bedo ki winy pi can ma en dong oneno. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Ka dong en oteggi ci Lubanga omiyo en odoko ngat makelo lare ma pe tum bot dano ducu ma winyo en. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Medo ikom meno, Lubanga cut oyere me bedo ajwaka madit ikit pa Melkijedek.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ciko jo ma mito ngak woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Watye ki lok mapol ma myero walok wunu ilok man, ento tek tutwal me niangowu, kit macalo wun dong wudoko nyap ka winyo lokwani. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:2">1 Kor 3:2</ref> </char></note> Kombedi onongo dong wuromo bedo lupwony, ento myero ngat mo kong dok opwonywu odoco ilok mukwongo ma dok ikom lok pa Lubanga. Mito kipitwu kong ki cak, ento pe cam matek. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Pien ngat ma doto cak pe tye ki ngec mo ma dok ikom bedo ki kit ma atir, pien nongo pud en latin, ma pe twero poko gin maber ki ikom marac. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Dong cam matek tye pi jo muteggi, ma ryekogi ma gupwonye kwede me poko gin maber ki gin marac dong ojing pi ketone i tic.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Pimeno, kong dong waweku lok mukwongo ikom Kricito, ento wamede anyim ki pwony pa jo muteggi, kun pe dok wanwoyo keto tegutine, ma en aye ngut ikom tic ducu mayam kwo pe iye, ki moko niyewa ikom Lubanga, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />ki dok me pwonye ikom lok magi: kit batija mapatpat, keto cing iwi dano, cer pa jo ma oto, ki kop ma kingolo matwal. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Wabitiyo man giwa ka Lubanga oye. <verse eid="HEB 6:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4-5" />Jo ma kong dong ceng oryeny omenyogi kicel, ma gubilo mot ma oa ki i polo, kun gibedo ikin jo mulimo Cwiny Maleng, ma bene dong gutyeko bilo lok pa Lubanga kit ma mit kwede dok gubilo gin ma bitime ikare ma bibino ianyim, kit jo macalo meno ka gungak woko, pe dok kitwero rocogi wek gudok manyen ka dong gunguti. <verse eid="HEB 6:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />Ka dong gungak woko, meno gitye ka guro Wod pa Lubanga ikom yatariya pirgi ken gi, kun giketo lewic ikome inyim lwak. <verse eid="HEB 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Pien Lubanga miyo gum ikom lobo ma mato kot ma cwer ikome kare ki kare, ka dok ceko ginapita ma konyo jo ma gipuru pirgi. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17">Aca 3:17</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 3:18">18</ref> </char></note> Ento kace onyayo okutu ki ocok, konye nongo dong pe, kuru mere acena pa Lubanga keken, agikine en aye mac ma kibiwango kwede woko. <verse eid="HEB 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Ento kadi bed aloko kit man, wun luwota, kadi bed waloko kit man, wageno ni wutye maber ma wukato jo meno ilok ma dok i lare. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Pien Lubanga gire pe ye gin ma pe tye kakare, wiye bene pe biwil ikom tic mayam wutiyo, kadi ki mar ma wunyutu pire ki konyo jo pa Lubanga, ma pud wutye ka konyogi bene wa ikareni. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Dong wamito ngat acel acel ikinwu oket cwinye nio wa agiki, wek omii gin ma wuketo iye genwuni ocobe kakare. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Wek pe wudok luwackom, ento wulub kit pa jo ma pi niyegi, ki pi diyo cwinygi, gitye ka nongo gin mayam Lubanga ociko pire.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cike me ada pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Ikare ma Lubanga cike bot Abraim, kit macalo onongo pe tye ngat mo makateni ki dit ni ma myero en okwong ki nyinge, en okwongo ki nyinge kekene, <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:16">Aca 22:16</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 22:17">17</ref> </char></note> kun waco ni, “Adada abimini gum, dok abimiyo likwayu ginya gidoko mapol.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Dong Abraim pi diyo cwinye omiyo en onongo gin mayam Lubanga ociko pire. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Ka dano mo kwongo kwong ci kwongo ki nying ngat madit loye, dok ka pyem mo tye ikin dano, lok ma kimoko ki kwong aye matyeko pyem meno. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Man aye gin ma omiyo Lubanga omoko cikene ki kwong, pien onongo mito nyutu maber tutwal bot jo ma myero gunong gin ma kiciko pire ni, gin ma en dong etyeko yubu, pe dok ebiloko woko. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Tye dong jami aryo ma pe dok loke, ma Lubanga pe twero bwolo iye dano.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lubanga pe labwola dok pe turu kwonge.</char></note> Piman, wan jo ma waringo walaro bote watye ki gin ma cuko cwinywa matek wek wamak gen ma kiketo inyimwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Lev 16:2</ref> </char></note> Watye ki gen man macalo lajuk me mel, ma cwinywa cung iye matek, ma pe wawire atata. Gen meno dong odonyo wa i Kabedo Maleng i Ot pa Lubanga, inge bongo kicika, <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Jab 110:4</ref> </char></note> kama Yecu otelo yo odonyo iye pirwa, kun dong odoko ajwaka madit pa Lubanga ma bedo nakanaka ikit pa Melkijedek.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s1">Kit pa Melkijedek ma obedo ajwaka pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melkijedek man yam obedo rwot me Calem, dok bene ajwaka pa Lubanga Mamalo Twal. En orwate ki Abraim ikare ma Abraim onongo dong dwogo ki ka neko luker ca, ci cut olamo gum ikom Abraim; <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />ka dong Abraim opoke dul acel me apar me jami ducu ma en onongo. Mukwongo en rwot me kit ma atir, man aye telok me nyinge, dok bene en rwot me Calem, ma teloke ni, “Rwot makelo kuc.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Pe tye gin mo ma nyutu lok kom wone nyo mine nyo kwarine, acaki me karene, kadi wa agiki me kwone bene pe kinyutu. En obedo cal ki Wod pa Lubanga, en bedo ajwaka nakanaka.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Kong wunen kit ma en dit kwede! Abraim, ma en aye kwarowa, yam omiyo bote dul acel me apar me jami ducu ma en oyako. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Wel 18:21</ref> </char></note> Dong jo ma ikin likwayo pa Levi ma gubedo ajwaki pa Lubanga, Cik pa Moses yam ocikogi me jogo dul acel me apar ki bot jo Icrael. Meno onongo kijogo ki bot utmegigi, kadi bed gin bene gubedo likwayo pa Abraim. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Ento danonu, ene Melkijedek ma kwarone pat ki meggi ni ogamo dul acel me apar ki bot Abraim, ka dok olamo gum ikom ngat ma Lubanga ocike bote. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Pe dok tye akalakala mo me waco ni, lalam gum dit kato ngat ma en lamo gum ikome. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Dok ki tungcel waneno ni, Lulevi ma gijogo dul acel me apar gin jo ma to woko, ento ki tung bot Melkijedek en ngat ma jogo acel me apar en ngat mayam kicoyo lok ikomeni pud kwo. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Ngat mo twero waco ni, ka Abraim, omiyo dul acel me apar, Lalevi bene kikome, ma jogo dul acel me apar, yam bene omiyo mere kun wok ki bot Abraim, <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />pien ikare ca onongo en pud tye ikom Abraim macalo nyig kodi ma Melkijedek orwate kwede ca ci bene ogamo acel me apare ki bot Levi.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Dong ka kono yam gin ducu twero cobe kakare pi ajwaki pa Lubanga ma gin Lulevi, ma jo Icrael yam gunongo cik pa Lubanga kacel kwedgi ni, pingo ki mito ni ajwaka mukene dok obin ikit pa Melkijedek, kun pe kiwaco ni, ikit pa Aron? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Pimeno ka dong kiloko ajwaka pa Lubanga, ci cik bene myero kilok woko. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Pien Rwotwa ma kiloko lok magi ikomeni obedo dano me kaka mukene, ma ngat mo ikin gi peya otiyo tic mo ikom keno tyer. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Ngene gire maber ni, Rwotwa yam oa ki ikin likwayo pa Juda, dok Moses yam pe oloko lok mo ikom kaka meno ma mako ajwaki pa Lubanga.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ajwaka pa Lubanga mukene ma cal ki Melkijedek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Lok man dong otyeko nen woko kamaleng makatone ka ajwaka pa Lubanga mukene otuc macalo Melkijedek, <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />ma odoko ajwaka pa Lubanga, pe pi cik mo ma lubu kaka, ento pi tek me kwone ma gin mo pe romo tyeko. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Jab 110:4</ref> </char></note> Pien coc mayam kicoyo oloko ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">“In i bibedo ajwaka pa Lubanga nakanaka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:17">ikit pa Melkijedek.”<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Cik macon dong kibolo woko, pien onongo goro, dok konye pe, <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />pien Cik pa Moses yam pe ocobo gin mo kakare, ento kombedi dong kikelo gen mo maber makato, ma dong twero miyo wanyiko cok bot Lubanga.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Medo ikom meno bene, Lubanga yam okwongo kwong ikome. Jo mukene ca gudoko ajwaki labongo kwong mo, <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Jab 110:4</ref> </char></note> ento Yecu odoko ajwaka pi kwong pa Lubanga mayam owace ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Rwot dong okwongo kwong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">ma pe dok biloko tame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘In ibedo ajwaka nakanaka.’”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Meno omiyo gicike ma Yecu ocung pire obedo ber makato mukene ca.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Ajwaki pa Lubanga mukene ca onongo yam welgi dwong, pien to onongo ogengo nyimgi woko wek pe gumede ki tic. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Ento Yecu bedo i dog tice me ajwaka pa Lubanga matwal, pien en bedo kwo nakanaka. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Ma omiyo ikare ducu en tye ki twer me laro jo ma nyiko cok bot Lubanga, kun giwok ki bote, pien en bedo kwo kare ducu ka bako doge bot Lubanga pirgi.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Ajwaka madit macalo meno aye maromo cobo mitiwa. En leng, gin mo marac pe i iye, cilo me bal bene pe ogude. Yam kipoko en woko ki ikom lubalo, ci kitinge malo iwi polo. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />En pe calo ajwaki mukene madito ca, ma gityero gitum bot Lubanga jwijwi, mukwongo pi balgi ken gi, ka lacen dong pi bal pa lwak. Yecu otyero gitum kicel keken ma otyeko lok ducu ikare ma omine kene macalo gitum. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Adada, Cik pa Moses yero jo magoro ketogi bedo ajwaki madito pa Lubanga, ento lok me kwong ma kikwongo lacen inge cik, oyero Wod pa Lubanga oketo obedo mupore matwal.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ajwaka madit pa Lubanga me gicike manyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Jab 110:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Kombedi gin ma pire dit ma watye ka lokone kany en aye ni: Wan watye ki ajwaka madit pa Lubanga macalo man, madong obedo i kabedo me deyo tung acuc inget komker pa Won Deyo Madit i polo. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />En tiyo tice i Kabedo Maleng, i kema me ada ma Rwot aye oguru, ento pe dano. <verse eid="HEB 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Ajwaka madit pa Lubanga acel acel kiyere me miyo mot ki tyero gitum bot Lubanga; pimeno mite bene ni Yecu myero obed ki gin mo me atyera. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Kono nene en tye i lobo kany, kono pe obedo ajwaka pa Lubanga wa ki acel, pien ajwaki pa Lubanga dong tye ma gimiyo mot kun gilubu Cik pa Moses. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">Nia 25:40</ref> </char></note> Ento gin ma gitiyo kiporo ki tipu ki cal keken me Kabedo Maleng matye i polo; pien ikare ma Moses dong yam cok guru kema, Lubanga ocike ni, “Nen ni itiyo jami ducu kun ilubu kit cal ma kinyuti ki iwi got.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Ento kit macalo tye, Kricito dong onongo tic maber atika makato meggi ni woko, rom ki kit gicike ma en oyubu ma obedo ber matek makato mukene macon ca, pien Lubanga omoko kun onongo ociko pi miyo jami mabeco makato. <verse eid="HEB 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Kono ka bal mo obedo pe i gicike mukwongo, kono onongo gicike mo me aryo dong pe mite.<verse eid="HEB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref> </char>
    </note> Ento Lubanga onongo bal tye ikomgi, pien owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Kare biromo, man lok pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">ma abimoko iye gicikena manyen ki jo me dogola pa Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">ki jo me dogola pa Juda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Pe dok bibedo calo gicike mayam aketo ki kwarigi ca,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">ikare mayam amako kwede cinggi ci akwanyogi woko ki i lobo Ejipt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">pien gin yam pe gulubu gicikena,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">omiyo an bene atenyogi woko ata, man lok pa Rwot<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Man aye gicike ma abiketo ki jo me dogola pa Icrael</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">ka kare meno oromo, man Rwot aye owaco:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Abiketo cika ducu itamgi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">abicoyo bene bedo i cwinygi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">An abibedo Lubangagi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">gin gibedo jona.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Ngat mo dong pe bipwonyo lutugi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">dok ngat mo bene pe ma biwaco ki lawote ni, ‘Nge Rwot,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">pien gin ducu gibingeyo an,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">cake ki ikom jo rwomgi piny ma ikin gi, oo kwede wa ikom jo rwomgi malo.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Pien abitimo botgi kica i timgi maracu ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:12">pe dok abipo ikom balgi mo kadi ki acel.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Ka oloko pi gicike manyen, en tamo pi gicike mukwongo ca macalo gin ma karene okato woko. Gin ma karene dong okato, ma otii woko bene, nongo dong cok rwenyo woko.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s1">Kabedo maleng me lobo ki me polo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />I gicike mukwongo ca yam obedo ki cik mogo me woro Lubanga, ki kabedo mo maleng ma i lobo man. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:1-30">Nia 26:1-30</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Nia 25:31-40</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Nia 25:23-30</ref> </char></note> Pien yam tye kema ma kiyubu, ma obedo ki dul acel yo tung woko ma kilwongo ni Kabedo Maleng, matye iye lacib mac, ki meja, ki mugati ma kiketo inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Nia 26:31-33</ref> </char></note> I nge bongo kicika me aryo yam tye iye kema ma kilwongo ni Kabedo Maleng Makato Ducu. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">Nia 30:1-6</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">Nia 25:10-16</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">c </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:33">Nia 16:33</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">d </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 17:8-10">Wel 17:8-10</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">e </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:16">Nia 25:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Nwo 10:3-5</ref> </char></note> Keno tyer ma kitiyo ki jabu tye iye kunu me wango odok eceta, ki Canduk me Gigike ma kimwono kome woko ki jabu. I Canduk me Gicike yam tye iye abino jabu ki manna ki odo pa Aron mayam olot ti, ki got ma apada aryo ma ceng kicoyo iye lok me gicikene. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Nia 25:18-22</ref> </char></note> Ka wi canduk yam tye iye lukerubi me deyo, ma guumu kom me kica woko ducu ki bwomgi. Jami magi pe watwero loko gin mo iye matut kombedi.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Wel 18:2-6</ref> </char>
    </note> Meno aye kit mayam kiyubu kwede. Ajwaki pa Lubanga yam gidonyo i kema jwijwi teretere ka cobo ticgi me woro Lubanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Lev 16:2-34</ref> </char></note> Ento kema me aryo ajwaka madit pa Lubanga keken aye donyo iye kene, dok bene donyo iye kicel keken i mwaka acel acel, kun pe cito kunu labongo remo, ma en tero me atyera pi bale ki pi bal pa lwak. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Man aye mamiyo Cwiny Maleng nyutu kamaleng ni, yo me donyo i Kabedo Maleng peya kiyabo ka kema mukwongo ma woko ca pud ocung. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Man aye cal gin ma nyutu kit me kare man. Man teloke ni, mot ki gitum ma kityero bot Lubanga pe twero miyo ngat mo ma woro Lubanga doko dano ma cwinye leng. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Pien gitiko ka kit me cam ki mat ki kit lwoko mapatpat. Magi ducu gubedo cik ma nen ki woko me kom matye katic nio wa ikare ma Lubanga biloko jami ducu bedo manyen.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Ento Kricito dong obino, ma en aye ajwaka madit pa Lubanga me jami mabeco ma bibino, kema ma en tiyo iye kato maca, odoko dit maber makato maca, pien pe kitiyo ki cing, ma teloke ni, pe gin me lobo man. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />En odonyo i Kabedo Maleng Makato Ducu kicel keken madong otyeko lok woko ducu, kun pe otero remo dyegi ki remo lutino twoni, ento otero remone kikome, ci okokowa kwede dong matwal. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:15">Lev 16:15</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 16:16">16</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 19:9">Wel 19:9</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 19:17-19">17-19</ref> </char></note> Remo dyegi ki twoni, ki buru roya ma kiwango, ka kikiro ikom jo ma gubalo kwer, romo lonyogi, kun lwoko komgi bedo maleng. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Remo pa Kricito mono pe kato maca mada? Pi Cwiny Maleng ma bedo matwal, omiyo en omine kene bot Lubanga kun roc mo pe ikome, pi lonyo cwinywu ma onongo dong ocido woko macol licuc pi tiyo tic ma kwo pe iye, wek wubed ma iwu leng, ka dong wawor Lubanga makwo.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Pimeno Kricito aye ngat ma yubu gicike manyen, wek emii jo ma gilwongogi gunong ginaleya ma rii nakanaka ma Lubanga ociko pire me miyone; pi to mayam oneno, omiyo jo mayam gikalo wi cik ite gicike mukwongo kombedi dong kikokogi woko. <verse eid="HEB 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Pien kama gicike me ginaleya tye iye, omyero kong kimok ni, ngat ma ociko ni dong oto. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Kodi gicike macalo meno twero tic lacen ki inge to keken; gicike ni pe tye ki twer mo ka ngat ma ociko ni pud kwo. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Pimeno kadi wa gicike mukwongo ca kimoko ki remo. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Nia 24:6-8</ref> </char></note> Pien ikare mayam Moses otyeko tito bot lwak gin ma kiciko ducu matye i Cik, en bene okwanyo remo roci dyangi ki dyegi, kacel ki pii, ki yer romo makwar, ki yat anyero, ci okiro ikom buk kikome, ki ikom lwak ducu bene, <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />kun waco ni, “Man aye remo me gicike ma Lubanga ocikowu pire.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lev 8:15</ref> </char></note> Dok i yo acelu, Moses okiro remo ikom kema ki jami ducu ma kitiyo kwedgi me woro Lubanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Lev 17:11</ref> </char></note> I te cik, nen calo jami ducu kilonyo woko ki remo; kama pe kioyo iye remo, weko bal bene bedo pe iye.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kricito obedo gitum ma kwanyo bal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Onongo opore dok kakare pi jami ma obedo lapor keken me gin matye i polo ni myero kilonygi gubed leng kitmeno, ento jami me polo kikomgi myero kilonygi ki gitum mabeco makato magigu ducu. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Pieno Kricito pe odonyo i Kabedo Maleng ma dano otiyo ki cing, ma ki poro ki Kabedo Maleng ma obedo me adane, en odonyo i polo kikome, ma ikare man en tye ka nen kunu inyim Lubanga dok pido pirwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Dok bene en pe odonyo me miine kene kare ki kare calo ajwaka madit pa Lubanga ma gidonyo i Kabedo Maleng mwaka ki mwaka kun tero remo ma pe remone kikome. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Ka nene obedo kitmeno, kono en onwoyo to kare ki kare cake i acaki piny. Ento kit matye kwedeni, en onen kicel keken i agiki me kare wek ekwany bal woko pi miine kene macalo gitum. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Dok kit macalo giyubu ni, dano to kicel, ka dong ki ingeye ngolo kop cake, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Ica 53:12</ref> </char></note> kitmeno Kricito bene otyere kene kicel me tingo bal pa jo mapol, dok binen tyen me aryo, pe dong pi tic ikom bal, ento pi laro jo matye ka kure.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Cik pa Moses gire tye iye tipu keken me jami mabeco me kare me anyim, ento pe ki kom jami ca kikome. Pi cik dano gibedo ka kelo gitum ma lakitgi acel nakanaka, mwaka ki mwaka; eno dong pe tye ki twero mo matwal me loko jo ma gibino bot Lubanga wek gudok jo mabeco muteggi. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Ka nene tye kitmeno, kono gitum pe dong ogik woko? Kono jo ma woro Lubanga dong kilwoko balgi woko matwal, kono pe dok gimede me bedo ki kit ngec mo i cwinygi ni gin lubalo. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Ento gitum magi bedo kapoyo wi dano ibalgi mwaka ki mwaka. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Pien remo twoni ki remo dyegi pe twero kwanyo bal woko wa ki acel. <verse eid="HEB 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Jab 40:6-8</ref> </char></note> Pi lok man, ikare ma Kricito obino i lobo, en oloko ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“In giri pe i mito gitum kadi gityer,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">ento iketo koma tye.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Ii bene pe obedo yom pi gitum awanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:6">ki gitum ma kityero pi bal.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Ka dong awaco ni, ‘An a ene, dong abino ka cobo mitini, in Lubanga,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">macalo yam kicoyo lok ikoma i buk adola.”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Mukwongo en oloko ni, “In pe i mito gitum, kadi mot ma kityero, nyo gitum awanga ki gitum pi bal, cwinyi bene pe yom iye,” ma gin jami ma kityero pi cik. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Ka dok oloko ni, “An a ene, dong abino ka cobo mitini.” Pimeno en ojwayo mukwongoneni woko wek dong ekel me aryone. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Dong pi mitine meno, omiyo kilonyowa wadoko leng pi Yecu Kricito ma omiyo kome ma ka gitum kicel keken ma otyeko lok woko ducu, en gitum ma pe miteni myero dok kityer odoco.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 29:38">Nia 29:38</ref> </char>
    </note> Ajwaka pa Lubanga acel acel cung i dog tice nino ducu kun tyero kit gitum acelu kare ki kare ma pe tye ki twero mo matwal me kwanyo bal. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Jab 110:1</ref> </char></note> Ento Kricito yam otyero gitum acel keken pi bal, pi kare ducu, ka dong obedo piny inget Lubanga tung acuc i kabedo me deyo. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Nia wa ikare ca en tye ka kuru kare ma kibimiyo lukwore doko kom laten tyene. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Pien gitume acelu omiyo jo ma en olonyogi bedo leng gudoko jo mabeco atika matwal. <verse eid="HEB 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Cwiny Maleng bene omiyo cadene botwa, pien ka dong oloko ni,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:33">Jer 31:33</ref> </char>
    </note> “Man aye gicike ma abiketo ki gin jona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">ka kare meno oromo, man lok pa Rwot:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Abiketo cika ducu i cwinygi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">kun acoyo bedo itamgi.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:34">Jer 31:34</ref> </char>
    </note> Ka dok omede kun loko ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">“Pe dok abipo ikom balgi ki timgi maracu.”<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Kama weko bal tye iye, gitum mo pi bal dong pe mite.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wanyiku cok ki Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Pimeno, utmegina, wan dong watye ki yo me donyo i Kabedo Maleng ki tekcwiny pi remo pa Yecu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />En oyabo botwa yo manyen, yo makwo, me donyo inge bongo kicika; yo meno aye obedo kom en. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Kit macalo dong watye ki ajwaka madit ma loyo ot pa Lubanga, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Lev 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Eje 36:25</ref> </char></note> myero dong wanyiko cok bot Lubanga ki cwiny me ada, kun niye bene dong odonyo matut i cwinywa, madong cwinywa leng, pien ngec me gin maracu mayam watimo dong kikwanyo woko, dok bene komwa dong kilwoko woko ki pii maleng. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Wamoku matek liking igen ma watucu, labongo tage atata, pien ngat ma ocikowani lagen. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Dok myero bene watamu kit macalo watwero tugu kwede cwinywa kekenwa me bedo i mar ki itiyo tic mabeco, <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />kun pe waweko coke kacel, kit macalo jo mogo dong guloko odoko kitgini, ento myero wacuku cwinywa kekenwa, makatone kit macalo bene wuneno Nino maca dong tye ka nyiko cok ki.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Pien ka watimo bal akaka madong nongo dong watyeko limo ngec ikom lok me ada, gitum mo peke dok ma odonge ma kityero pi balwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Ica 26:11</ref> </char></note> Odong kuru ngolo kop keken kun watye ki lworo madwong, ki mac mager ma bityeko dano ma gipyem ki Lubanga. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Nwo 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref> </char></note> Dano ma pe lubu Cik pa Moses yam kineko woko aneka labongo kica mo, kace lok oloye inyim caden aryo nyo adek. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Nia 24:8</ref> </char></note> Dong wutamoni kibiketo can marom mene ikom ngat ma ocayo Wod pa Lubanga, dok ma opyedo remo me gicike pa Lubanga ma kilonye kwede me bedo malengi, dok ma ongalo Cwiny Maleng me kica pa Lubanga? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Nwo 32:35</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:36">Nwo 32:36</ref> </char></note> Pien wan wangeyo ngat ma oloko ni, “An aye abiculu kwor, abiculu wange lacen,” dok ni, “Rwot bingolo kop ikom jone.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Bedo gin me lworo tutwal me poto i cing Lubanga makwo.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Ento kong dong wupo ikare mukato, kit mayam wuciro kwede ayelayela mapol, kun wulwenyo ki lwak can madwong, ikare madong ceng pa Lubanga otyeko ryeny omenyowu. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Kare mukene yam kiyetowu dok kiunuwu inyim lwak, kare mukene bene wuribe ki jo ma kitimogi kitmeno. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Wubedo ki kica ikom mabuc dok onywako kwedgi ican ma yam omakogi pien nongo gudoko jo ma guye Kricito, dok bene cwinywu obedo yom kadi ka jo me giyako jamiwu, pien wun ki komwu onongo dong wungeyo ni wutye ki jami mukene mabeco makato magi i polo, dok ma rii nakanaka makato magi ma kiyakoni. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Pimeno pe wubwot tek cwiny woko, pien ka wutye kwede ci wubilimo mot madit ma bino pire. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Mite ni wubed kun wuciro te kare, wek omii wutii gin ma Lubanga mito, ci dong miyo wunongo gin mayam en ociko pire. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Kab 2:4</ref> </char></note> Macalo yam en oloko ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“Odong kare manok mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">ci ngat ma bino ca bibino woko oyotoyot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">dok en pe bigale.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Dong danona ma kite atir bibedo kwo pi niye;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">ento ka danoni odok gire woko cen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:38">ci cwinya pe bibedo yom ikome.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Ento wan pe watye ikin jo ma dok cen, ka girwenyo woko matwali; wan watye ikin jo ma gitye ki niye, ma en aye dong gwoko kwogi.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s1">Niye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Niye aye ma moko gin ma dano geno, en gin ma niangowa maber ni, jami ma pe kineno komgi gitye ada. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Lubanga ceng opwoyo jo macon pi niye.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:1">Aca 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Jab 33:6</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 33:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:3">Jon 1:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye waniang ni, Lubanga yam ocweyo lobo kulu ki loke, ma omiyo gin manen kitiyo nia ki ikom gin ma pe nen.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Aca 4:3-10</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye Abel otyero gitum maber makato pa Kain woko bot Lubanga; meno omiyo kipwoye ni kite atir, kun Lubanga aye obedo cadene pi gamo mote. En oto, ento pi niyene omiyo en pud loko.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Aca 5:21-24</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye omiyo Enoka yam kitingo kitero woko malo wek pe obil to. Pe kimedo ki nongone, pien Lubanga onongo dong otere woko. Ikare ma pud peya kitere, kimiyo lok me caden ikome, ni oyomo cwiny Lubanga. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Labongo niye pe twere me yomo cwiny Lubanga, pien ngat ma mito nyiko cok bot Lubanga myero oye ni en tye ada, dok bene ni en miyo mot bot jo ma yenye.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 6:13-22">Aca 6:13-22</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye Nua bene, ka Lubanga ociko en pi gin ma peya onen, en owinyo doge, ka dong opayo yeya pi laro jo me ode. Pi niyenenu omiyo rankop oloyo lobo, oweko en onongo kit ma atir ma obino pi niye.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Aca 12:1-5</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye Abraim owinyo dog Lubanga ikare ma olwonge me cito i lobo mo mukene ma onongo yam Lubanga mito miine ni obed mere. En oa ki i lobo tugi kun pe ngeyo kama ecito iye. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Aca 35:27</ref> </char></note> Pi niye omiyo en obedo macalo welo i lobo mayam Lubanga ociko pire, macalo ebedo i lobo pa lurok, kun bedo i kema, kit ma Icaka ka Yakobo bene yam gubedo, ma gin bene kimiyogi kit cike acelu. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Pien Abraim onongo tye ka kuru gang ca matye ki gutine ducu matek, ma Lubanga aye obedo ngat mugoyo calle, ki lagedone kikome.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Aca 18:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye omiyo Cara onongo tek me yaco, kadi bed mwaka me nywale onongo dong okato woko. Man otime pien en otamo ni, ngat ma ocikoni gene. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Aca 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:12">32:12</ref> </char></note> Man omiyo ikom laco acel, mayam rom ki ngat ma oto, oa iye lwak likwayo mapol ata calo lakalatwe me polo, ki dok calo kweyo me dog nam ma kwanone loyo dano wokoni.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 23:4">Aca 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1 Tek 29:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Jab 39:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Jo magi ducu guto kun gitye ki niye ikom gin ma ceng Lubanga ociko pire botgi. Gin pe gunongo gin ma kiciko ca ento guneno anena ki kamabor, ci gujolo ki cen. Gin bene gutucu ni gin gibedo macalo lurok dok welo oring ayela iwi lobo. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Pien jo ma loko lok kitmeno ginyutu kamaleng ni gitye kayenyo lobo tugi kikome. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Ka kono nene gubedo ka tamo pi lobo mayam gin gua ki iye ca, kono gunongo yo me dok woko cen iye. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Ento gin gitye ka paro pi lobo maber makato maca ca woko, en aye pacogi ma i polo. Pimeno lewic pe mako Lubanga kace gin lwonge ni Lubangagi, pien en dong otyeko yubu botgi gang.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Pi niye Abraim, ka yam kiteme, otyero Icaka macalo gitum bot Lubanga; ngat ma Lubanga ocike bote oyube me tyero wode acel keken macalo gitum bot Lubanga, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Aca 22:1-14</ref> </char></note> mayam giloko pire ni, “Lutino pa Icaka aye kibilwongogi ni likwayu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Aca 21:12</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />En onongo otamo ni, Lubanga tye ki twero me cero dano ki ikin jo ma oto; dok bene kitwero waco ni Icaka odwogo i cing Abraim calo oa ki ikin jo ma oto.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Aca 27:27-29</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:39">39</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 27:40">40</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye Icaka olamo gum ikom Yakobo ki Ecau pi kare me anyim.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:21: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 48:1-20">Aca 48:1-20</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 47:31">Aca 47:31</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye Yakobo bene, ka dong cok ka to, olamo gum ikom lutino pa Yucepu, kun lamo ikom latin acel acel, ma okulu wiye iwi odo me komone, kun woro Lubanga.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 50:24">Aca 50:24</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 50:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Nia 13:19</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye Yucepu, i agiki me kwone, oloko pi a pa jo Icrael ki i Ejipt, ka dong ociko pi tingo kom lyele ma oto ni wek kiter woko i lobo Kanaan ka jo Icrael a ki Ejipt.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:2">Nia 2:2</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:22">Nia 1:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye, kayam kinywalo Moses, ci lunyodone gukane pi dwe adek kun pe gulworo cik pa rwot Parao, pien onongo guneno ni latin ca ber mada.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:10-12">Nia 2:10-12</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye Moses, ka dong odongo, pe oye ni omyero kilwonge ni en e wod pa nya pa Parao, <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />kun oyero me neno can kacel ki jo pa Lubanga ma ka bedo ki yomcwiny i timo bal ma rii pi kare manok mo keken ni. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />En otamo ni yet ma giciro pi Kricito obedo lonyo madit makato lonyo ducu matye i Ejipt, pien onongo ociko wange kun neno mot me kare me anyim.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Pi niye Moses oa woko ki i Ejipt kun pe olworo kiniga pa rwot; ociro matek, macalo en neno Lubanga ma pe nen.<verse eid="HEB 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Nia 12:21-30</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye bene omiyo Moses okwero Nino Madit me Kato, dok okiro remo, wek omii lanek lutino kayo pe ogudgi.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Nia 14:21-31</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye jo Icrael gungolo Nam Makwar macalo giwoto ki iwi ngom mutwo; ento jo Ejipt gumwony woko liweng i nam ikare ma gin bene gutemo me kato kitmeno.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 6:12-21">Yoc 6:12-21</ref> </char>
    </note> Pi niye omiyo cel me Jeriko orete opoto woko piny madong jo Icrael gurumu pi nino abiro. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:22-25">Yoc 6:22-25</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Yoc 2:1-21</ref> </char></note> Pi niye Rakab ma obedo malaya pe oto kacel ki jo ma pe gubedo luwiny, pien onongo en yam ojolo lurotpiny ki kuc.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:32: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 6:11-8:32">Lung 6:11—8:32</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 4:6-5:31">Lung 4:6—5:31</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">c </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 13:2-16:31">Lung 13:2—16:31</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">d </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 11:1-12:7">Lung 11:1—12:7</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">e </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:1-2:11">1 Cam 16:1—1 Luk 2:11</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">f </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:1-25:1">1 Cam 1:1—25:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Gin ango makato meno ma dok amede me lokone? Pien kare aye bibedo nok bota me titiwu pi Gideon, Barak, Samson, Jeputa, Daudi, Camuel ki lunebigu, <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:1-27">Dan 6:1-27</ref> </char></note> ma gin bene pi niye omiyo gulwenyo ki luker me lobo mapatpat, guloyogi, gutiyo gin matye atir, ci gunongo gin mayam Lubanga ociko pire. Gutweyo dog labworgu woko, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:1-30">Dan 3:1-30</ref></char></note> guneko mac mager woko, gubwot ki ilak pala lucwan. Gorogi oloke odoko tekom, gudoko jo matek i lweny, ci guryemo mony pa lurok woko. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:17-24">1 Luk 17:17-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:25-37">2 Luk 4:25-37</ref> </char></note> Mon gunongo danogi mayam gin oto madong gucer woko. Jo mukene kigoyogi marac, guto kun gukwero ni pe kigonygi, wek gibicer i kwo maber makato. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:26">1 Luk 22:26</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 22:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25">2 Tek 18:25</ref>,<ref loc="2CH 18:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Jer 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15">37:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38:6</ref> </char></note> Jo mukene kingalogi, kipwodogi, kitweyogi ki nyor ci kiketogi i buc. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2 Tek 24:21</ref> </char></note> Kicelogi ki got, kinguno igi woko i dul aryo ki mucumeno, kinekogi ki pala lucwan. Gin gulongo piny kun guruku laa romi ki laa dyegi, ma nongo can oketo komgi woko, dano ounugi dok kitimogi ki tim maracu. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Kit jo macalo meno lobo onongo dong pe ber pirgi. Gubedo kawot awota atata i tim calo oring ayela, ki iwi godi, kun gibedo iboro ki bur mugware matut piny i ngom.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Jo magi gingene maber pi niyegi, ento dok pe gumedo ki nongo gin mayam Lubanga ociko pire, <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />pien onongo Lubanga oyubu gin mo maber makato kun otamo pirwa, ni meno, gin pe myero gudok jo mabeco muteggi labongo wan.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga Wonwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Dong kit macalo watye ki lwak caden mapol marom meno ma orumuwa woko dyere, myero kong dong wabolu gin manuruwa woko ducu, ki bal bene ma maro tweyowa woko liking, wek waringu dong ngwec me pyem matye inyimwa, kun waciro bene peko matye iye. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Wanenu Yecu ma en aye latel wiwa ilok kom niye, en ngat ma ocobo niyewa kakare. Pi yomcwiny ma kiketo inyime en yam ociro can ikom yatariya, kun ocayo lewic ma kiketo ikome; ento kombedi dong obedo piny i kabedo me deyo yo tung acuc me komker pa Lubanga.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Wubed ki tam ikome, ki kit ma en ociro kwede adagadaga marac tutwal ki bot lubalo, wek pe wuol, ki iwu bene pe oari woko. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />I lwenywu ma wulwenyo ki bal pud peya wulwenyo wuo wa i oyo remowu. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:17">Yub 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:11">Car 3:11</ref>,<ref loc="PRO 3:12">12</ref> </char></note> Nyo wiwu owil woko ce i coc mayam kicoyo me cuko cwiny dano, ma en loko kwedwa iye macalo lutinone? Ni meno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Latina, pe i caa pwony pa Rwot;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">ka en ogoyi, ii bene pe oari woko.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Pien Rwot juyu jo ma en maro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:6">dok pwodo latin acel acel ma en jolo bote.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Wuden can macalo pwod ma wonwu tye ka pwodowu kwede me tirowu. Lubanga tye katic kwedwu macalo lutinone. Latin mene ma pe wone tengo? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Kace owekowu labongo tirowu macalo lutinone mukene ducu, mono nyutu ni wun dong lutino luk, ento pe lutinone kikome. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Kitmeno wan watye ki wegiwa me lobo man mayam gupwodowa, wan bene waworogi. Pe dong omyero wamine makato ite loc pa Wonwa me cwiny wek wabed kwo! <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Pien gin yam gupwodowa me tirowa pi kare manok mo keken ikit ma gin guneno ni ber, ento Lubanga pwodowa pi konyowa, wek omii wadok jo maleng macalo en. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Kit pwod ducu, ka pud watye iye, pe watamoni obedo me yomcwiny, ento me kumu, ento i ngeye lacen kelo kuc keken bot jo ma gukato ki iye, pien nongo dong gudoko jo ma kitgi atir.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dano pe gukwer kica pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:3">Ica 35:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Pimeno, wuting badwu mukwe ni malo, wurye congwu magoro, <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Car 4:26</ref> </char></note> wuyub yo ma tyenwu lubu obed atir, wek ngat ma tyene goro pe ongol woko, ento myero ocang woko acanga. <verse eid="HEB 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Wuket tek me bedo ki kuc ki jo ducu, ki me bedo jo maleng; pien ngat ma pe leng pe bineno Rwot. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Nwo 29:18</ref> </char></note> Wugwoke kun wuneno maber ni ngat mo pe okeng nongo kica pa Lubanga. Wunen ni ngat mo pe obedo macalo lwit yat makec ma ka otwi ci kelo ayela, dok balo jo mapol. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Aca 25:29-34</ref> </char></note> Wunen ni ngat mo pe obed latim abor ikinwu, nyo dano ma pe lworo Lubanga calo Ecau, mayam ocato dite me anywali me bedo latin kayo pi cam me tyen acel keken. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Aca 27:30-40</ref> </char></note> Pien wungeyo ni, lacen ka en omito ni wone olam gum ikome, ento wone okwere woko, kadi bed onongo mito ma kok ki pig wange, pien en yam pe onongo yo me ngut i gin ma en otimo.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">Nia 19:16-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">20:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:11">Nwo 4:11</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 4:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:22-27">5:22-27</ref> </char>
    </note> Pien wun pe wubino igin ma kitwero gudu kome, ki mac mayam olyel iwi got Cinai, ki colpiny me mutu ma ocido woko licuc, ki yamo lapiru matek, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />ki koko tum, ki dwon ngat matye kalok. Jo ma guwinyo loke gubako doggi mada ni pe dok kimed loko lok mo botgi, <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12">Nia 19:12</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:13">13</ref> </char></note> pien gin pe gitwero ciro cik ma kiketo, ni meno, “Kadi ki lee mo ka ogudu got, omyero kicel ki gweng kinek woko.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Nwo 9:19</ref> </char></note> Gin munen kunu obedo marac tutwal ma miyo dano lworo, man omiyo Moses owaco ni, “Lworo omaka adada ma koma myel amyela.” <verse eid="HEB 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Ento wun wubino igot me Cion, ki gang pa Lubanga makwo, Jerucalem me polo, ki bot lwak lumalaika ma welgi pe kwane ma gucoke kacel ka woro Lubanga ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Wun wubino i coke pa lutino kayo ma kicoyo nyinggi i polo, ki bot Lubanga ma en langolkop pa dano ducu, ki bot tipu pa jo ma kitgi atir, madong gimiyo gudoko jo mabeco muteggi, <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Aca 4:10</ref> </char></note> wun wubino bot Yecu, ma en aye layub gicike manyen ikin dano ki Lubanga, ki bot remo ma kikiro, ma tito pi gin maber makato gin ma remo pa Abel otito pire.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:22">Nia 20:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Wugwoke pe wukwer winyo lok pa ngat matye kalok. Jo mayam gukwero winyo lok pa ngat ma ocikogi iwi lobo pe gubwot. Wan kono wabibwot ningning, ka wakwero winyo lok pa ngat matye ka cikowa ki iwi polo kuluni? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Agg 2:6</ref> </char></note> Ikare maca, dwone oyengo lobo; ento kombedi en ociko ni, “Tyen mukene, pe dong abiyengo lobo keken, ento abiyengo wa polo bene.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Lok man ni, “Odong tyen kicel mukene,” nyutu ni, kibikwanyo gin ma yenge woko, meno ginacweya, ka gin ma pe yenge cako dong. <verse eid="HEB 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Pimeno myero wapwoyu Lubanga, pien dong wanongo ker ma pe twero yenge, dok bene myero waworu Lubanga i yo matwero yomo cwinye, kun bene wamiye deyo ki lworo, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Nwo 4:24</ref> </char></note> pien Lubangawa en aye mac ma wango piny.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s1">Tic ma yomo cwiny Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Wumede ki mar ikinwu kekenwu macalo utmego. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Aca 18:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19:1-3</ref> </char></note> Wiwu pe owil ka jolo welo, pien jo mogo mayam gugwoko welo onongo gugwoko lumalaika ipacogi kun pe gingeyo. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Wupo pi jo matye i buc calo wutye kacel kwedgi i buc kunu. Wupo bene pi jo ma gitimogi ki tim marac, kit macalo wun bene wutye ikom. <verse eid="HEB 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Jo ducu myero guket deyo ikom nyom, dok kitanda pa jo ma gunyome myero giwor obed maleng; pien Lubanga bingolo kop ikom lutim tim me abor ki jo ma balo nyomgi. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Nwo 31:6</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Yoc 1:5</ref> </char></note> Pe wubed jo ma maro lim; jami ma wutye kwede myero oromwu, pien Lubanga yam oloko ni, “Pe abiboli, pe abibwoti ata.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Jab 118:6</ref> </char></note> En aye gin ma omiyo cwinywa tek, kun wawaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Rwot en lakony mera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">pe abibedo ki lworo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Ngo kono ma dano twero timo ikoma?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Wupo ikom lutela wiwu macon, mayam gutitiwu lok pa Lubanga. Wutam pi kwogi ki gin maber ma oa iye, ka dong wulub niyegi. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yecu Kricito gire tye kite acel keken laworo ki tin ki nino ma pe tum. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Pe wuwek pwony mogo mapatpat dok ma welo gurwenywu woko; ber kica pa Lubanga aye ma omii teko i cwinywa, pe pi cik me cam mogo ma dano ma gulubu bene pe gunongo iye kony mo. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Watye ki keno tyer ma lutic i kema macon ca pe gitye ki twero mo me cam iye. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:27">Lev 6:27</ref> </char></note> Pien lee mayam ajwaka madit pa Lubanga tero remogi i Kabedo Maleng me bedo gitum pi bal, komgi yam kiwango woko cen inge gony. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Kitmeno bene Yecu yam oto wa cen woko inge dogcel, wek omii elony dano ki remone kikome wek gubed maleng. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Pimeno myero wacitu bene woko inge gony, kun waciro anywar pire. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Pien kany pe watye ki taun madit mo ma rii nakanaka, ento watye kayenyo taun madit matye ianyim macok bino. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Dong wamiyo pakwa bot Lubanga ikare ducu macalo gitum ma kityero bot Lubanga, kun wawok ki bot Yecu; meno aye pak ma wamiyo ki dogwa ka watucu nyinge. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Pe myero wiwu owil katimo gin maber, ki poko jami ma wutye kwede bene bot jo mukene; pien gitum macalo meno yomo cwiny Lubanga.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Wuwiny lok pa jo ma telowu, dok wumiine ite locgi, pien gin gitye ka gwoko tipuwu labongo yweyo macalo jo ma Lubanga bipenyogi pi ticgi. Wumii gutii ticgi ki yomcwiny, ma pe wumiyogi peko mo, pien meno pe konyowu kadi ki acel.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Wuleg Lubanga pirwa, pien wan wangeyo ada ni cwinywa gire leng, dok wamito ni watii gin maber kare ducu. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Amedo cuko cwinywu ni wuleg Lubanga, wek odwoka botwu oyotoyot.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega me gikone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Lubanga won kuc ma ocero Rwotwa Yecu Kricito ki ikin jo muto, ma en aye lakwat madit ma kwayo wan romine, pi remo me gicikene ma rii nakanaka, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />en myero omiwu gin ducu mabeco mamite, wek wutii wucob gin ma en mito; dok bene pi Yecu Kricito omyero en otii kwedwa gin ma yomo cwinye. Deyo obed bot Yecu Kricito nakanaka. Amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lok me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Utmegina, alegowu ni wudii cwinywu i loka ma acoyo manoknok moni ma acuku kwede cwinywu. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Myero wunge ni ominwa Temceo dong kigonyo woko; wabibino kwede ka nenowu, kace orune obino oyot. <verse eid="HEB 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Wumot lutelawu ducu, ki jo pa Lubanga bene ducu. Jo wa ma oa ki i Itali gumotowu.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Kica pa Lubanga obed kwedwu ducu.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>